        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Barbara Daly Baekeland, Antony \"Tony\" Baekeland, Eddie Redmayne\n- Works: Savage Grace, Like Minds, The Good Shepherd, The Yellow Handkerchief, The Other Boleyn Girl\n- Topics: dysfunctional relationships, alleged incest, murder, film roles\n\nFacts:\n- Barbara Daly Baekeland was born in 1922.\n- Eddie Redmayne's first film roles came in 2006 in Like Minds and The Good Shepherd.\n- Savage Grace is based on the dysfunctional and allegedly incestuous relationship between heiress and socialite Barbara Daly Baekeland and her son, Antony Baekeland.\n- In 2007, Eddie Redmayne played a supporting role in Savage Grace.\n- In 2007, Eddie Redmayne also played a supporting role in The Yellow Handkerchief.\n- In 2008, Eddie Redmayne played a supporting role in The Other Boleyn Girl.\n- Barbara Daly Baekeland was murdered by her son, Antony \"Tony\" Baekeland, on November 17, 1972.",
